// g-bootstrap-validity-spec-silences-s449 (a): reading a child field's `submitted`.
<program>
    <signup:struct>
        let <email:string="" req/>
        renders <input bind:value=@email/>
    </>
    renders <form><*email/></form>
    <main>
        <*signup/>
        <p>${@signup.email.submitted}</p>
    </main>
</program>
